    <h3>File upload rules</h3>
    <p>-</p>    
    <ul class="g-help-list">
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Check file extension.</b> When this flag is enabled, the file extension is checked during the upload process;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Check file content MIME type.</b> When this flag is enabled, the file content MIME type is checked;</li>
