        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_combo"></span> <b>File extensions to check.</b> Specifies the list of file extensions to be checked during upload.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>The new file name after uploading it</h3>
    <p>The generation of the new filename upon completion of the upload is determined by a set of fields:</p>    
    <ul class="g-help-list">
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Filename transliteration.</b> When enabled, Cyrillic characters in the filename are converted to Latin characters;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Generate unique filename.</b> When enabled, the system generates a unique filename when saving the uploaded file;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Exclude special characters from filename.</b> When enabled, the system removes or replaces characters in the filename that could cause errors or unpredictable behavior in file systems, scripts, URLs, or interfaces;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Lowercase filename.</b> When enabled, all letters in the filename are converted to lowercase;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_text"></span> <b>Replace special characters with.</b> All special characters in the filename are replaced with the specified character;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_spinner"></span> <b>Maximum filename length.</b> Sets the maximum allowed length for the filename. If the actual length exceeds the specified value, the filename is automatically truncated to the set limit while preserving the extension.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Setting values to PHP directives on every file upload</h3>
    <p>PHP directive value are set using the following fields:</p>
    <ul class="g-help-list">
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_checkbox"></span> <b>Set PHP directive values.</b> When this option is enabled, the system automatically sets the values for the PHP directives listed below;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_text"></span> <b>Maximum upload file size.</b> The maximum upload file size is set using PHP directives;</li>
        <li><span class="g-help-fld g-help-fld_spinner"></span> <b>Maximum number of uploaded files.</b> The maximum number of uploaded files is set using PHP directives.</li>
