    <h3>PHP directive configuration to pass maximum allowed data size</h3>
    <p>The following are the key configuration parameters used to manage file uploads. Each parameter controls a specific aspect of the process:</p>
    <ul>
        <li><b>Maximum allowed size of data sent via the POST method</b>;</li>
